# GMS throws it in two parts: 400+8x% at one enemy, then on hit an explosion of
# 45+3x% six times on six. Here the explosion is the swing and the first throw
# is its lead hit (see lead_enemies in fight.h). Merging them into one column
# would give bystanders a shuriken only the target takes.
#
# The Assassin's only attack, so it has no cooldown: a cooldown is for
# alternating a pair, as magicians do, and there is no pair here.
#
# Two enemies against GMS's six. The explosion's own box is 200x220, a burst at
# the struck monster's feet wide enough for it and one neighbour, whatever GMS
# lets it count. See Skill.max_enemies.
name: "Shuriken Burst"
description:
  "Throw exploding shurikens that ricochet to nearby enemies on hit. "
  "Shurikens detonate when they hit their first enemy."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ASSASSIN skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base_delay_ms: 720
max_enemies: 2
lines: 6
lead_lines: 1
base {
  skill_pct: 0.48
  lead_pct: 4.08
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.03
  lead_pct: 0.08
}
